1
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,845
<font color="white">Madam! Come take a look!</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:15,015
<font color="white">-You won't find it cheaper!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Best you'll find, I tell you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

3
00:00:20,395 --> 00:00:21,271
<font color="white">Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:31,322
<font color="white">Welcome, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:35,326
<font color="white">I mean, Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:41,416
<font color="white">The weather is quite warm.</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,044
<font color="white">I find myself rather damp.</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:47,422
<font color="white">Shall we begin?</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:55,865
<font color="white">Can a painting truly capture it all?</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:56,449 --> 00:01:58,785
<font color="white">I am rendering it as soft and smooth</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:58,868 --> 00:02:01,371
<font color="white">as a freshly boiled egg,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">peeled just moments ago.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

12
00:02:01,454 --> 00:02:02,455
<font color="white">Rather than me,</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:03,081 --> 00:02:05,291
<font color="white">be sure to capture him well.</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:07,127 --> 00:02:08,711
<font color="white">What sort of man is he?</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:08,795 --> 00:02:11,840
<font color="white">A man blessed beyond measure</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">below the waist.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

16
00:02:11,923 --> 00:02:13,716
<font color="white">As you well know,</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:16,010
<font color="white">that is not something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">one acquires through practice.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

18
00:02:16,553 --> 00:02:19,681
<font color="white">It is something one is born with,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as is everything in this world.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

19
00:02:20,181 --> 00:02:22,684
<font color="white">He was abundantly blessed, that one.</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:23,518 --> 00:02:26,563
<font color="white">But his blessings did not end there.</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:27,939 --> 00:02:30,233
<font color="white">The tip of his tongue…</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:33,486 --> 00:02:35,697
<font color="white">was as smooth as silk.</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:36,447 --> 00:02:38,575
<font color="white">And those great hands…</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:40,243 --> 00:02:43,288
<font color="white">Just thinking of them</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">makes me tingle down below.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

25
00:02:46,166 --> 00:02:49,085
<font color="white">Be sure to capture</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the look on my face right now.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

26
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:51,087
<font color="white">Do not concern yourself with that.</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:02:51,171 --> 00:02:52,463
<font color="white">Keep going. Do not stop.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:02:52,547 --> 00:02:54,966
<font color="white">It feels as though</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he is beginning to move.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

29
00:02:56,217 --> 00:02:57,927
<font color="white">My hand moves of its own accord,</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:02:58,511 --> 00:03:00,138
<font color="white">as though possessed.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:13,443 --> 00:03:15,653
<font color="white">Who on earth is this man?</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:17,071 --> 00:03:19,157
<font color="white">If he's so generous with his blessings,</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:20,408 --> 00:03:22,410
<font color="white">I'd like to meet him myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:22,994 --> 00:03:24,746
<font color="white">I'm afraid that will be difficult.</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:25,705 --> 00:03:26,539
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:26,623 --> 00:03:30,126
<font color="white">Because I may soon make him rue the day.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:31,085 --> 00:03:33,171
<font color="white">How dare he trifle with my only daughter?</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:33,254 --> 00:03:34,964
<font color="white">What a scoundrel.</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:36,382 --> 00:03:37,759
<font color="white">Would you like me to step in?</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:03:38,468 --> 00:03:41,930
<font color="white">If you wish, I could meet him myself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and teach him a lesson.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

41
00:03:50,813 --> 00:03:55,860
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:03:55,944 --> 00:03:57,153
<font color="white">You have been upset</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:03:57,862 --> 00:04:00,406
<font color="white">because I never sent word</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after that day, have you not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

44
00:04:01,032 --> 00:04:03,117
<font color="white">I would be lying if I said I was not.</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:05,161 --> 00:04:08,289
<font color="white">But I never meant to deceive you.</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:09,624 --> 00:04:12,252
<font color="white">I simply found myself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">growing more and more fond of you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

47
00:04:17,507 --> 00:04:19,467
<font color="white">I have done a great deal of thinking.</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:22,136 --> 00:04:24,555
<font color="white">You lied to me,</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:25,473 --> 00:04:27,016
<font color="white">and I was betrayed.</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:28,059 --> 00:04:30,228
<font color="white">I could not forgive you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without a second thought.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

51
00:04:34,315 --> 00:04:37,443
<font color="white">But when I heard</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that my sister-in-law had passed,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

52
00:04:38,528 --> 00:04:40,613
<font color="white">you were the first person</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who came to mind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

53
00:04:42,532 --> 00:04:44,784
<font color="white">I realized I did not want to lose you.</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:51,332 --> 00:04:52,292
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,086
<font color="white">I cannot be an unfilial son.</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:56,379 --> 00:04:57,839
<font color="white">Since my brother passed,</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:59,507 --> 00:05:01,884
<font color="white">my mother has placed all her hopes in me.</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:05,054 --> 00:05:06,139
<font color="white">Compared to my brother,</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:08,016 --> 00:05:09,017
<font color="white">I cannot measure up.</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:11,561 --> 00:05:12,979
<font color="white">But she still believes in me.</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:14,314 --> 00:05:16,024
<font color="white">I cannot fail her.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:18,276 --> 00:05:19,485
<font color="white">I am sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:20,653 --> 00:05:21,904
<font color="white">You are lying.</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:27,618
<font color="white">-You simply dislike me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-No.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

65
00:05:28,828 --> 00:05:30,038
<font color="white">That is not true.</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:32,874
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:38,212 --> 00:05:39,380
<font color="white">I do not dislike you.</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:40,465 --> 00:05:41,507
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:43,426 --> 00:05:45,928
<font color="white">What happened to your face?</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:47,263 --> 00:05:48,389
<font color="white">Did you run into something?</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:50,725
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:52,727
<font color="white">Surely no one would have hit you.</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:05:54,812 --> 00:05:56,064
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:19,921
<font color="white">I was taught this is how it is done.</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:22,298 --> 00:06:23,174
<font color="white">Miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:25,259 --> 00:06:26,511
<font color="white">What have you been learning?</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:28,346 --> 00:06:30,348
<font color="white">-Did you not like it?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-No.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

78
00:06:35,978 --> 00:06:37,188
<font color="white">I liked it.</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:40,483 --> 00:06:44,195
<font color="white">Young master,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we shall see each other again, right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

80
00:06:44,278 --> 00:06:45,154
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:16,811 --> 00:07:18,646
<font color="white">Eun-sil, was it?</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:18,729 --> 00:07:20,064
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:21,899 --> 00:07:22,775
<font color="white">Eun-sil, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:06,944
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:15,745
<font color="white">Over here.</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:08:16,329 --> 00:08:17,163
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:26,631 --> 00:08:27,757
<font color="white">Young… Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:29,800
<font color="white">What are you doing here so late?</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:08:33,137 --> 00:08:34,680
<font color="white">I was gathering my lady's clothes.</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:35,890 --> 00:08:37,475
<font color="white">Even if they're to be burned,</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:37,558 --> 00:08:40,436
<font color="white">she should at least be dressed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in clean clothes when she goes,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

92
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,938
<font color="white">so I mean to wash them.</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:44,607 --> 00:08:45,566
<font color="white">And these?</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:46,484 --> 00:08:48,945
<font color="white">Mrs. Ganghwa told me to throw them away.</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:53,491 --> 00:08:54,450
<font color="white">You seem busy.</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:56,661 --> 00:08:57,954
<font color="white">I must keep busy.</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:59,330 --> 00:09:00,456
<font color="white">Good night, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:10:24,123 --> 00:10:26,542
<font color="white">Keep your mouth shut. Understood?</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:10:33,049 --> 00:10:33,966
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:10:37,637 --> 00:10:38,679
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:11:33,275 --> 00:11:34,985
<font color="white">If you are so curious,</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:11:35,069 --> 00:11:36,320
<font color="white">why don't you come inside?</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:11:36,404 --> 00:11:37,279
<font color="white">No, I couldn't.</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:40,533
<font color="white">Good night, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:12:18,863 --> 00:12:20,072
<font color="white">Catholicism.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:12:26,662 --> 00:12:27,913
<font color="white">Here, have a look at this.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:12:29,248 --> 00:12:31,584
<font color="white">Her Highness will be</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seated here in the center,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

108
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:36,922
<font color="white">and we will fill this space</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with musicians and dancers.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

109
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:40,468
<font color="white">Just look at this clear view.</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:12:40,551 --> 00:12:42,803
<font color="white">Surely she will be pleased,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">wouldn't you say?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

111
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:46,849
<font color="white">Yes, I am certain she will.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:12:46,932 --> 00:12:49,059
<font color="white">Of course, the banquet itself is</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what matters most.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

113
00:12:50,728 --> 00:12:53,063
<font color="white">Whenever I think about it,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it gives me quite the headache.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

114
00:12:53,564 --> 00:12:54,899
<font color="white">I know that is false modesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:59,320
<font color="white">Your talents have always been exceptional.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:13:00,196 --> 00:13:02,239
<font color="white">Why else would you have been sent here?</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:13:04,825 --> 00:13:08,120
<font color="white">If only His Majesty thought so too.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:13:10,122 --> 00:13:11,040
<font color="white">By the way…</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:13:11,916 --> 00:13:13,417
<font color="white">-Yes?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Given how busy you are,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

120
00:13:13,501 --> 00:13:16,712
<font color="white">I doubt you summoned me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">all the way here just to show me this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

121
00:13:17,421 --> 00:13:18,339
<font color="white">Right.</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:13:20,299 --> 00:13:22,885
<font color="white">A royal decree has arrived for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:13:22,968 --> 00:13:26,847
<font color="white">A MATTER OF GREAT IMPORTANCE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">REQUIRES DISCUSSION</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:13:26,931 --> 00:13:30,684
<font color="white">CHO WON IS HEREBY SUMMONED TO THE PALACE</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:13:35,439 --> 00:13:36,398
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:13:38,817 --> 00:13:41,987
<font color="white">To be honest, there is something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I have long wondered about.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

127
00:13:45,407 --> 00:13:47,952
<font color="white">It is not that I look down on you.</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:13:48,035 --> 00:13:49,036
<font color="white">It is just…</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:13:50,621 --> 00:13:55,709
<font color="white">I mean, everyone knows</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the sort of things you write.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

130
00:13:55,793 --> 00:13:58,003
<font color="white">They ought to incur His Majesty's wrath,</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:13:58,963 --> 00:14:02,550
<font color="white">yet somehow</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you still receive royal summons.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

132
00:14:08,722 --> 00:14:11,475
<font color="white">How on earth did you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">come to stand at His Majesty's side?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

133
00:14:12,643 --> 00:14:14,228
<font color="white">I do not stand at his side.</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:14:16,522 --> 00:14:18,399
<font color="white">I am merely</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:14:19,149 --> 00:14:20,651
<font color="white">being punished there.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:16:40,791 --> 00:16:42,126
<font color="white">You have returned.</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:16:59,810 --> 00:17:01,603
<font color="white">Did your business go well?</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:17:08,152 --> 00:17:09,194
<font color="white">I'm sorry I'm late.</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:17:11,613 --> 00:17:13,032
<font color="white">I meant to wait up for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:17:13,866 --> 00:17:14,908
<font color="white">Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:17:18,078 --> 00:17:19,705
<font color="white">You must have been quite exhausted.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:17:21,415 --> 00:17:22,708
<font color="white">You were snoring.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:17:26,879 --> 00:17:28,380
<font color="white">Snoring?</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:17:31,133 --> 00:17:32,551
<font color="white">That cannot be.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:17:33,802 --> 00:17:35,137
<font color="white">Do not be embarrassed.</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:17:38,557 --> 00:17:42,061
<font color="white">Even if thunder rolled from your nose…</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:17:46,565 --> 00:17:47,691
<font color="white">in my eyes,</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:17:48,192 --> 00:17:52,112
<font color="white">neither Yang Guifei nor Xi Shi</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:17:53,489 --> 00:17:54,865
<font color="white">could compare to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:17:55,908 --> 00:17:57,618
<font color="white">Please do not jest so.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:17:58,577 --> 00:17:59,787
<font color="white">I am not jesting.</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:18:00,704 --> 00:18:01,663
<font color="white">I mean it.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:18:20,849 --> 00:18:22,309
<font color="white">Rest easy.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:18:26,897 --> 00:18:28,816
<font color="white">I shall retire to the outer quarters.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:19:25,455 --> 00:19:26,790
<font color="white">What a state for a lady's face.</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:19:36,341 --> 00:19:39,803
<font color="white">I thought you knew proper script.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:42,973
<font color="white">Why are you writing in vernacular script?</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:19:43,056 --> 00:19:45,434
<font color="white">I know it all too well.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">That is why I feign ignorance,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

159
00:19:46,143 --> 00:19:47,811
<font color="white">lest it cause trouble.</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:51,398
<font color="white">Can knowing too much ever cause trouble?</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:19:53,817 --> 00:19:55,986
<font color="white">It is a petition</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to be submitted to His Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

162
00:19:56,695 --> 00:19:58,322
<font color="white">It ought to be written this way.</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:19:58,405 --> 00:19:59,781
<font color="white">To His Majesty?</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:19:59,865 --> 00:20:03,744
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor's wife asked me</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:20:04,578 --> 00:20:06,371
<font color="white">to submit a petition for her.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:20:07,497 --> 00:20:08,665
<font color="white">How admirable.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:20:09,333 --> 00:20:12,794
<font color="white">You are truly</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the finest woman in all Joseon.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

168
00:20:14,004 --> 00:20:15,380
<font color="white">Spare me the flattery.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:20:19,885 --> 00:20:22,054
<font color="white"><i>Could even a flower in full bloom</i></font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:25,515
<font color="white"><i>have been as fair as she?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:20:26,808 --> 00:20:29,937
<font color="white"><i>She looked ever so serene</i></font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:34,983
<font color="white"><i>when she arrived in a white palanquin,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>clad in mourning robes</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:20:35,067 --> 00:20:37,402
<font color="white"><i>before she had worn her bridal silks.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:20:38,654 --> 00:20:41,156
<font color="white"><i>Longing for the husband</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>she had never even met,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:45,410
<font color="white"><i>she devoted herself wholly</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to virtue and filial piety.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:48,747
<font color="white"><i>At times, I could not help but pity her.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:20:54,002 --> 00:20:54,836
<font color="white">Lady Cho.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,880
<font color="white"><i>Yet as a fellow woman,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:20:57,381 --> 00:21:02,386
<font color="white"><i>I believe her virtue deserves</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to be honored and made known.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:21:03,387 --> 00:21:06,181
<font color="white"><i>Thus, in the hope that she may serve</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>as an example to all women,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:21:06,265 --> 00:21:10,185
<font color="white"><i>I humbly submit this petition,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>though I have no ties to her</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:21:11,061 --> 00:21:13,146
<font color="white"><i>either by blood or by marriage.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:21:17,484 --> 00:21:18,860
<font color="white">Did you pressure her into it?</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:21:18,944 --> 00:21:19,903
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:21:20,988 --> 00:21:22,322
<font color="white">Whatever are you talking about?</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:21:22,406 --> 00:21:23,532
<font color="white">Did you not ask Yoo's wife</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:21:23,615 --> 00:21:26,118
<font color="white">to petition for Hui-yeon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to be recognized as a virtuous woman?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:21:29,621 --> 00:21:32,582
<font color="white">Is there anyone in Hanyang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who does not know her reputation</font><font color="white"></font></font>

189
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:34,876
<font color="white">for wisdom and virtue?</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:38,255
<font color="white">I merely thought that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if she could be of some help,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

191
00:21:38,338 --> 00:21:39,339
<font color="white">I should…</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:48,890
<font color="white">I did not do it for myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:21:50,183 --> 00:21:51,852
<font color="white">I did it for this family.</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:21:53,353 --> 00:21:54,771
<font color="white">Since Geum-ho died,</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:21:56,106 --> 00:21:57,524
<font color="white">what is left</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:21:58,608 --> 00:22:00,902
<font color="white">of this family?</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:22:01,486 --> 00:22:02,696
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:22:03,447 --> 00:22:05,532
<font color="white">We did not lose only Geum-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:22:07,075 --> 00:22:08,577
<font color="white">We lost the pillar…</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:22:10,871 --> 00:22:11,955
<font color="white">of this family.</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:22:12,789 --> 00:22:15,459
<font color="white">If Your Lordship</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">will not step in, then I shall.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

202
00:22:15,542 --> 00:22:18,670
<font color="white">Is that not the only way</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to ease Geum-ho's grievance?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

203
00:22:18,754 --> 00:22:20,672
<font color="white">The one with a grievance is you,</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:22:21,506 --> 00:22:23,216
<font color="white">not Geum-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:22:27,012 --> 00:22:28,889
<font color="white">We have yet to recover Hui-yeon's body.</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:22:28,972 --> 00:22:30,390
<font color="white">Show some restraint!</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:22:33,310 --> 00:22:34,269
<font color="white">Geum-ho…</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:22:36,563 --> 00:22:38,565
<font color="white">keeps appearing in my dreams.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:22:40,942 --> 00:22:43,111
<font color="white">My son comes to me</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:22:43,695 --> 00:22:45,280
<font color="white">and weeps his heart out.</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:48,575
<font color="white">He does not say anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:22:49,910 --> 00:22:51,453
<font color="white">He only weeps.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:22:56,541 --> 00:23:00,003
<font color="white">Should we not at least raise</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a Memorial Gate for his wife's virtue?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

214
00:23:02,005 --> 00:23:04,257
<font color="white">It is the only thing</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:23:05,675 --> 00:23:07,636
<font color="white">I can do for my son, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:23:09,012 --> 00:23:09,888
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:23:14,518 --> 00:23:16,686
<font color="white">Father, it is I.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:23:31,409 --> 00:23:32,327
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:23:32,953 --> 00:23:34,412
<font color="white">Has something happened?</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:39,376
<font color="white">What is that in your hand?</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:23:51,054 --> 00:23:54,391
<font color="white">I found it in Hui-yeon's quarters.</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:24:01,189 --> 00:24:05,610
<font color="white">INTRODUCTION</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">TO ESSENTIAL CATHOLIC TEACHINGS</font><font color="white"></font></font>

223
00:24:09,656 --> 00:24:10,949
<font color="white">It's a book on Catholicism.</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:24:27,340 --> 00:24:29,050
<font color="white">Do you truly mean to tell me</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:24:29,134 --> 00:24:31,219
<font color="white">you did not know Hui-yeon was a Catholic?</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:24:31,303 --> 00:24:32,470
<font color="white">I didn't know!</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:24:32,554 --> 00:24:34,472
<font color="white">I really don't know anything!</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:24:34,556 --> 00:24:35,682
<font color="white">Mrs. Ganghwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:24:35,765 --> 00:24:36,808
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:24:36,892 --> 00:24:39,477
<font color="white">I care not if she can never walk again.</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:24:39,561 --> 00:24:41,521
<font color="white">Beat her until she opens her mouth!</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:24:41,605 --> 00:24:42,480
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:44,566
<font color="white">Madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:24:45,192 --> 00:24:46,902
<font color="white">Madam, it's true!</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:24:47,485 --> 00:24:50,780
<font color="white">I cannot tell you what I don't know!</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:24:53,658 --> 00:24:54,492
<font color="white">Fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:24:56,077 --> 00:24:57,662
<font color="white">Then let me change the question.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:24:58,330 --> 00:25:00,790
<font color="white">What was it that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you carried out of her room?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

239
00:25:01,499 --> 00:25:02,334
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:25:03,919 --> 00:25:06,504
<font color="white">The more you lie,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the more beatings you will earn.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

241
00:25:06,588 --> 00:25:07,797
<font color="white">Tell the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:25:11,635 --> 00:25:13,637
<font color="white">Well, those were…</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:25:15,138 --> 00:25:18,225
<font color="white">You seem reluctant to answer.</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:25:23,104 --> 00:25:24,356
<font color="white">I'll tell you!</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:25:24,439 --> 00:25:25,565
<font color="white">I can tell you!</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:25:26,191 --> 00:25:27,901
<font color="white">They were…</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:25:29,152 --> 00:25:30,403
<font color="white">They were letters…</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:25:33,073 --> 00:25:35,158
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won sent her.</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:25:36,284 --> 00:25:37,202
<font color="white">Cho Won?</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:25:37,786 --> 00:25:40,413
<font color="white">You mean Minister Yoo's brother-in-law?</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:25:41,915 --> 00:25:43,041
<font color="white">Letters?</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:25:44,626 --> 00:25:45,669
<font color="white">Mrs. Ganghwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:25:46,253 --> 00:25:47,254
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:25:47,337 --> 00:25:49,464
<font color="white">Go fetch every cane in the house.</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:25:49,547 --> 00:25:53,718
<font color="white">I have a feeling</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there's much more to hear from this one.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

256
00:25:53,802 --> 00:25:54,678
<font color="white">Oh…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:25:56,096 --> 00:25:57,055
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:26:10,443 --> 00:26:12,904
<font color="white">Madam, please spare me!</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:26:12,988 --> 00:26:15,323
<font color="white">I didn't do it because I wanted to!</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:26:15,407 --> 00:26:18,785
<font color="white">Minister Yoo's wife ordered me to,</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:26:18,868 --> 00:26:20,412
<font color="white">and I had no choice!</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:26:21,454 --> 00:26:22,914
<font color="white">I'm telling you the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:26:22,998 --> 00:26:23,915
<font color="white">Who…</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:26:25,583 --> 00:26:26,876
<font color="white">Who ordered you?</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:26:28,503 --> 00:26:29,796
<font color="white">Minister Yoo's…</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:26:31,673 --> 00:26:32,841
<font color="white">wife.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:26:52,402 --> 00:26:54,112
<font color="white">Who does that man look like to you?</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:26:55,447 --> 00:26:56,448
<font color="white">Hard to say.</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:26:58,950 --> 00:27:00,785
<font color="white">It cannot be,</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:27:01,745 --> 00:27:03,163
<font color="white">but is it Lord Cho Won?</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:27:05,749 --> 00:27:06,624
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:27:07,417 --> 00:27:08,585
<font color="white">That will do.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:27:08,668 --> 00:27:10,837
<font color="white">I got my money's worth.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:27:15,633 --> 00:27:17,093
<font color="white">There was a man</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:27:18,219 --> 00:27:21,806
<font color="white">who went about scolding women's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">secret places with his great hands.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

276
00:27:23,475 --> 00:27:27,604
<font color="white">They say more than a few women</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">soaked their undergarments because of him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

277
00:27:28,855 --> 00:27:31,524
<font color="white">Was his pounding truly so remarkable?</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:27:33,026 --> 00:27:34,069
<font color="white">And just then,</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:27:34,694 --> 00:27:38,031
<font color="white">there happens to be a woman of Bukchon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who has not been seen of late.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

280
00:27:43,787 --> 00:27:46,873
<font color="white">Perhaps she sits across from that man,</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:27:47,540 --> 00:27:50,877
<font color="white">legs spread and breath coming fast.</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:27:55,382 --> 00:27:58,635
<font color="white">Where might that woman be?</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:28:01,179 --> 00:28:03,598
<font color="white">-Be sure the man looks exactly the same.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, ma'am.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

284
00:28:04,265 --> 00:28:06,017
<font color="white">Take particular care with the man.</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:28:06,101 --> 00:28:07,185
<font color="white">-Yes, sir.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

286
00:28:13,900 --> 00:28:14,734
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:28:28,289 --> 00:28:31,000
<font color="white">Madam! Where are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:28:31,084 --> 00:28:32,377
<font color="white">I'm here!</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:28:33,628 --> 00:28:37,048
<font color="white">It has spread beyond Bukchon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to Jungchon and Namchon as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

290
00:28:37,132 --> 00:28:40,844
<font color="white">The problem is that the rumors</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are taking a rather strange turn.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

291
00:28:40,927 --> 00:28:42,929
<font color="white">The timing is just too perfect.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:28:43,555 --> 00:28:45,557
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

293
00:28:49,477 --> 00:28:51,062
<font color="white"><i>There was a man…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:28:51,146 --> 00:28:52,689
<font color="white"><i>"Come visit me once."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:28:52,772 --> 00:28:55,692
<font color="white"><i>-…who went about scolding women's…</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-"And scold this</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:28:55,775 --> 00:28:57,110
<font color="white"><i>drenched little thing of mine."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:29:04,492 --> 00:29:05,535
<font color="white">Your Ladyship.</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:29:06,119 --> 00:29:07,662
<font color="white">It is too scandalous to repeat.</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:29:18,298 --> 00:29:19,132
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:22,802
<font color="white">There you are.</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:29:22,886 --> 00:29:23,887
<font color="white">Hello, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:29:23,970 --> 00:29:25,638
<font color="white">I rushed over the moment I heard--</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:29:25,722 --> 00:29:29,100
<font color="white">We both seem to be busy,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so let us dispense with pleasantries.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

304
00:29:30,977 --> 00:29:31,811
<font color="white">Right.</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:29:32,896 --> 00:29:35,148
<font color="white">Why did you spread those rumors?</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:29:36,232 --> 00:29:37,066
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:29:38,193 --> 00:29:39,402
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:29:39,486 --> 00:29:41,237
<font color="white">Was it my cousin you resented?</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:29:44,073 --> 00:29:47,035
<font color="white">Or the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

310
00:29:48,870 --> 00:29:50,121
<font color="white">If neither,</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:29:51,372 --> 00:29:53,958
<font color="white">have I done you some grave wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:29:55,168 --> 00:29:57,754
<font color="white">A wrong? No, madam. Of course not.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:29:57,837 --> 00:29:58,755
<font color="white">Then what is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:29:59,839 --> 00:30:01,591
<font color="white">Why would you do such a thing?</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:30:02,217 --> 00:30:05,637
<font color="white">Is there something you want from me?</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:30:10,266 --> 00:30:11,100
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:13,895
<font color="white">I do not wish for much.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:30:14,896 --> 00:30:17,273
<font color="white">I only want So-ok to be</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the young madam of this house…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

319
00:30:17,357 --> 00:30:21,194
<font color="white">No, I mean, a concubine</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and live comfortably. That is all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

320
00:30:21,945 --> 00:30:24,364
<font color="white">But if Lord Cho Won's visits</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to her quarters</font><font color="white"></font></font>

321
00:30:24,948 --> 00:30:26,157
<font color="white">were to get her cast off,</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:30:26,908 --> 00:30:28,827
<font color="white">would that not break her mother's heart?</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:30:29,619 --> 00:30:30,745
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:30:31,746 --> 00:30:34,165
<font color="white">could you simply promise me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that So-ok will never be</font><font color="white"></font></font>

325
00:30:34,874 --> 00:30:36,292
<font color="white">turned out of this house?</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:30:37,085 --> 00:30:39,254
<font color="white">That I have nothing to fear?</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:30:40,296 --> 00:30:41,130
<font color="white">Please?</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:30:44,092 --> 00:30:45,760
<font color="white">So this is blackmail.</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:30:45,844 --> 00:30:47,387
<font color="white">And from the likes of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:30:47,470 --> 00:30:50,014
<font color="white">Mrs. Ganghwa! The palanquin is ready!</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:31:06,990 --> 00:31:08,491
<font color="white">A merchant's nerve</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:31:08,575 --> 00:31:10,368
<font color="white">is something else indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:31:10,451 --> 00:31:12,704
<font color="white">Gather up every copy you have put out.</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:31:12,787 --> 00:31:14,581
<font color="white">They must not spread</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">beyond the city gates.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

335
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:17,166
<font color="white">Yes, I'll collect every one of them.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:31:17,250 --> 00:31:19,294
<font color="white">Every last one.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:31:19,377 --> 00:31:21,921
<font color="white">Leave quietly. Do not make a sound.</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:31:22,589 --> 00:31:23,506
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:31:30,930 --> 00:31:32,181
<font color="white">Let us go.</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:31:53,912 --> 00:31:54,829
<font color="white">There is</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:31:56,331 --> 00:31:58,333
<font color="white">something rather amusing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">circulating in Bukchon.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

342
00:31:59,959 --> 00:32:03,087
<font color="white">The man described and depicted in it</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:32:03,963 --> 00:32:05,798
<font color="white">does seem familiar.</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:32:11,638 --> 00:32:13,681
<font color="white">But I pay it no mind,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so you need not worry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

345
00:32:15,308 --> 00:32:16,684
<font color="white">You already told me</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:32:17,852 --> 00:32:20,480
<font color="white">of your cousin's indiscretions after all.</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:32:22,190 --> 00:32:23,232
<font color="white">Even if</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:32:24,442 --> 00:32:27,320
<font color="white">those indiscretions happened to involve</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">someone in my house…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

349
00:32:30,698 --> 00:32:32,700
<font color="white">What good would come</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of dredging them up now?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

350
00:32:36,454 --> 00:32:37,288
<font color="white">Oh,</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:32:38,247 --> 00:32:39,082
<font color="white">of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:32:39,666 --> 00:32:43,711
<font color="white">I do find it rather galling that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you knew something and kept it from me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

353
00:32:43,795 --> 00:32:45,755
<font color="white">But I shall not ask for an explanation.</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:32:45,838 --> 00:32:46,714
<font color="white">Instead…</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:32:48,841 --> 00:32:50,718
<font color="white">just see to it that what Eun-sil delivered</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:32:51,344 --> 00:32:53,554
<font color="white">is dealt with properly.</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:55,848
<font color="white">One more thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:32:56,933 --> 00:32:59,852
<font color="white">I need a Memorial Gate for Hui-yeon.</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:33:01,396 --> 00:33:04,023
<font color="white">If only you would exert yourself</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:33:05,775 --> 00:33:07,193
<font color="white">a little more on that matter.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:33:12,156 --> 00:33:14,534
<font color="white">Am I asking too much?</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:33:16,911 --> 00:33:17,996
<font color="white">Not at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:33:23,918 --> 00:33:24,919
<font color="white">This is</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:33:26,587 --> 00:33:28,047
<font color="white">a most interesting place.</font><font color="white"></font>

365
00:33:44,689 --> 00:33:45,648
<font color="white">It doesn't hurt, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:33:49,652 --> 00:33:52,113
<font color="white">Isn't that your mistress over there?</font><font color="white"></font>

367
00:33:52,196 --> 00:33:53,573
<font color="white">Move a little closer to the side.</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:33:54,741 --> 00:33:56,784
<font color="white">It's only a few steps,</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:33:56,868 --> 00:33:59,328
<font color="white">yet she always insists on</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">riding in a damn palanquin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

370
00:34:00,997 --> 00:34:03,958
<font color="white">Easy! I told you to move gently!</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:34:04,042 --> 00:34:06,127
<font color="white">Sorry. Does it hurt that much?</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:34:06,878 --> 00:34:08,713
<font color="white">What, did you think</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it'd only hurt a little?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

373
00:34:08,796 --> 00:34:10,757
<font color="white">It feels like</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my calves are being torn apart.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

374
00:34:11,591 --> 00:34:15,386
<font color="white">I'll move like a snake,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">nice and smooth, all right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

375
00:34:15,887 --> 00:34:17,680
<font color="white">So you won't feel a thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:34:18,264 --> 00:34:19,640
<font color="white">Nice and smooth.</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:34:19,724 --> 00:34:22,435
<font color="white">Just hurry up.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">If I'm late, I will only get an earful.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

378
00:34:23,186 --> 00:34:24,187
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:34:24,812 --> 00:34:26,147
<font color="white">Silk for sale!</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:29,609
<font color="white">-Nice and smooth like this.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Fine silk!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

381
00:34:30,401 --> 00:34:32,361
<font color="white"><i>Why is there still no word</i></font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:34:32,445 --> 00:34:34,739
<font color="white"><i>from the one who promised to come soon?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:34:35,364 --> 00:34:37,116
<font color="white"><i>I have something to tell you,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:34:37,200 --> 00:34:39,535
<font color="white"><i>so I wish you would make haste.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:34:39,619 --> 00:34:41,579
<font color="white">My lord, may I come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:35:27,792 --> 00:35:30,044
<font color="white">Did you make all of this yourself?</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:35:30,128 --> 00:35:31,838
<font color="white">Mrs. Asan and I prepared it together.</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:35:52,942 --> 00:35:54,610
<font color="white">Come and take a look!</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:35:54,694 --> 00:35:56,404
<font color="white"><i>I have an idea. Here.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:35:56,487 --> 00:35:59,282
<font color="white">Like this. Well?</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:35:59,949 --> 00:36:01,617
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:36:02,285 --> 00:36:03,911
<font color="white">I cannot see a thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:36:06,164 --> 00:36:07,165
<font color="white">How about now?</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:36:10,042 --> 00:36:13,129
<font color="white">There are countless things</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that can only be seen today.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

395
00:36:13,212 --> 00:36:15,047
<font color="white">Today comes but once, does it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:36:15,673 --> 00:36:17,341
<font color="white">There are many places I wish to take you.</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:36:20,052 --> 00:36:22,680
<font color="white">This will do. There.</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:36:26,809 --> 00:36:28,311
<font color="white">Come and have a look!</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:36:28,394 --> 00:36:30,980
<font color="white">Buy some taffy! Fresh taffy!</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:36:31,689 --> 00:36:33,858
<font color="white">Good sir! Have a look at this taffy!</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:36:33,941 --> 00:36:36,944
<font color="white">Come now. It's nice and sweet!</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:36:42,575 --> 00:36:43,409
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:37:13,272 --> 00:37:15,024
<font color="white">The stones are quite slippery.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:37:15,107 --> 00:37:16,943
<font color="white">Here, this should help.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:41:55,513 --> 00:41:56,972
<font color="white"><i>There will come a day…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:41:59,308 --> 00:42:00,935
<font color="white"><i>when I look back on this night.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:42:03,646 --> 00:42:06,649
<font color="white">I fear the memory may fade.</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:42:13,822 --> 00:42:14,990
<font color="white">It frightens me terribly.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:42:17,201 --> 00:42:18,702
<font color="white">Are you such a coward?</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:42:49,066 --> 00:42:51,860
<font color="white">Why do you suddenly look so sad?</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:42:55,447 --> 00:42:57,074
<font color="white">I am so happy that…</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:43:00,828 --> 00:43:01,704
<font color="white">somehow…</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:43:05,833 --> 00:43:07,251
<font color="white">it makes me uneasy.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:43:45,247 --> 00:43:47,541
<font color="white">I want to etch into your heart</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:43:51,795 --> 00:43:53,922
<font color="white">how much this night means to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:43:56,759 --> 00:43:58,260
<font color="white">Will you let me?</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:44:02,473 --> 00:44:04,183
<font color="white">Etch it deeply.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:44:06,477 --> 00:44:07,853
<font color="white">I wish to hold on to it.</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:44:23,702 --> 00:44:26,288
<font color="white">Are you truly going to see His Majesty?</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:44:26,830 --> 00:44:29,166
<font color="white">Why? Do you not believe me?</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:44:29,792 --> 00:44:30,751
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:44:31,835 --> 00:44:32,711
<font color="white">It's only that</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:44:33,629 --> 00:44:36,507
<font color="white">I feel there is still so much</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I do not know about you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

424
00:44:38,509 --> 00:44:40,344
<font color="white">I shall be back before you go to sleep.</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:44:40,427 --> 00:44:41,804
<font color="white">Nothing will happen.</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:44:46,058 --> 00:44:48,143
<font color="white">I have agreed to go work with her.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:44:49,144 --> 00:44:52,189
<font color="white">It seems safer to go with her</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:44:53,232 --> 00:44:55,025
<font color="white">than to stay here alone all day.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:44:56,193 --> 00:44:59,571
<font color="white">When you say work, do you mean farm work?</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:45:00,155 --> 00:45:01,115
<font color="white">It's all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:45:02,741 --> 00:45:04,827
<font color="white">As you said, nothing will happen.</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:45:04,910 --> 00:45:06,245
<font color="white">Even so, how could you…</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:45:06,328 --> 00:45:08,914
<font color="white">I'll be with her the whole time.</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:45:08,997 --> 00:45:10,707
<font color="white">I won't let her do any hard work,</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:45:10,791 --> 00:45:13,001
<font color="white">so just be on your way, young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:45:16,797 --> 00:45:20,634
<font color="white">Come now. If you're to be back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before she goes to sleep, you must hurry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

437
00:45:34,982 --> 00:45:36,233
<font color="white">Wait, my lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:45:47,828 --> 00:45:48,912
<font color="white">Well, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:46:06,472 --> 00:46:09,349
<font color="white">I have pressed my heart into these words.</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:46:09,975 --> 00:46:12,728
<font color="white">Please keep them close.</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:46:15,522 --> 00:46:16,815
<font color="white"><i>Then can you write</i></font><font color="white"></font>

442
00:46:18,942 --> 00:46:22,571
<font color="white">a heartfelt account</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the sound of that widow's door opening</font><font color="white"></font></font>

443
00:46:24,406 --> 00:46:25,866
<font color="white">after 20 long years?</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:46:26,783 --> 00:46:29,828
<font color="white">Can you prove it to me in writing?</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:46:56,313 --> 00:46:57,397
<font color="white">I will be back.</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:48:02,921 --> 00:48:04,965
<font color="white">I was cutting away like this,</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:48:05,048 --> 00:48:07,676
<font color="white">then I ran out of strength</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:48:07,759 --> 00:48:10,137
<font color="white">and fell right on my bum!</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:48:22,649 --> 00:48:24,109
<font color="white">You have arrived in good time.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:48:26,695 --> 00:48:28,614
<font color="white">At Your Majesty's command,</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:48:29,156 --> 00:48:31,074
<font color="white">I, Cho Won, have come from Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:48:31,158 --> 00:48:34,244
<font color="white">I received your reply</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to my secret directive.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

453
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:36,163
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:48:36,246 --> 00:48:38,832
<font color="white">the construction</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is progressing swiftly in practice?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

455
00:48:39,416 --> 00:48:40,542
<font color="white">It is, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:48:40,626 --> 00:48:43,086
<font color="white">Most notably, the craftsmen's productivity</font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:48:43,170 --> 00:48:44,796
<font color="white">has risen considerably.</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:48:44,880 --> 00:48:48,300
<font color="white">I suspect that since wages are now paid</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">according to ability,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

459
00:48:48,383 --> 00:48:51,386
<font color="white">they take pride in that distinction alone.</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:48:51,470 --> 00:48:53,221
<font color="white">And I trust it may also serve</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:48:53,305 --> 00:48:56,475
<font color="white">as motivation</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for those beneath them to strive harder?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

462
00:48:56,558 --> 00:48:57,434
<font color="white">Indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:48:58,852 --> 00:49:01,063
<font color="white">I believe the work may well be completed</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:49:01,146 --> 00:49:03,774
<font color="white">years ahead of the original schedule.</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:49:05,192 --> 00:49:07,861
<font color="white">Provided the high officials</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">do not stir up any trouble.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

466
00:49:09,571 --> 00:49:10,405
<font color="white">Now,</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:49:10,489 --> 00:49:13,533
<font color="white">I summoned you in such haste</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for another matter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

468
00:49:21,958 --> 00:49:23,669
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor's daughter-in-law</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:49:24,336 --> 00:49:26,588
<font color="white">returned to her hometown</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and passed away there.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

470
00:49:28,090 --> 00:49:32,135
<font color="white">They have yet to find her body,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as no one knows exactly where she died.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

471
00:49:33,220 --> 00:49:35,263
<font color="white">I wish to commend her filial devotion,</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:49:35,347 --> 00:49:38,141
<font color="white">but the fellow insists he will not have it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">unless the body is found.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

473
00:49:38,225 --> 00:49:40,686
<font color="white">How am I to overrule such stubbornness?</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:49:42,145 --> 00:49:45,649
<font color="white">I hear her hometown lies</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">near the construction site in Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

475
00:49:47,025 --> 00:49:48,902
<font color="white">Do you think</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you could search for her remains?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

476
00:49:59,579 --> 00:50:01,289
<font color="white">As you command, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:50:11,508 --> 00:50:13,385
<font color="white">-Goodness.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-There.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

478
00:50:17,931 --> 00:50:21,184
<font color="white">Look, go have something to drink</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and rest a spell.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

479
00:50:22,310 --> 00:50:24,438
<font color="white">All right? Go on.</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:50:50,088 --> 00:50:51,965
<font color="white">I will be back in a moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

481
00:50:52,048 --> 00:50:53,049
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

482
00:51:21,995 --> 00:51:23,789
<font color="white">A bumper harvest!</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:51:23,872 --> 00:51:26,875
<font color="white">-It has ripened beautifully!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Indeed!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

484
00:51:26,958 --> 00:51:27,959
<font color="white">Hui-yeon!</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:51:29,336 --> 00:51:30,212
<font color="white">Hui-yeon!</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:51:34,508 --> 00:51:35,383
<font color="white">Hui-yeon.</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:51:39,513 --> 00:51:41,765
<font color="white">Hui-yeon. It is I, In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:51:43,308 --> 00:51:44,476
<font color="white">You are alive?</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:51:59,449 --> 00:52:00,408
<font color="white">In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:52:01,535 --> 00:52:02,452
<font color="white">How is it</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:52:04,204 --> 00:52:05,497
<font color="white">that you are here?</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:52:16,258 --> 00:52:17,926
<font color="white">I was on my way to see Master Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

493
00:52:20,095 --> 00:52:21,805
<font color="white">But if you are here, then I…</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:52:26,685 --> 00:52:27,561
<font color="white">In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:52:28,812 --> 00:52:30,021
<font color="white">In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:52:30,772 --> 00:52:31,648
<font color="white">In-ho!</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:52:44,202 --> 00:52:47,080
<font color="white">What brings you here at this hour?</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:52:47,163 --> 00:52:49,416
<font color="white">Madam, have you heard?</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:52:50,458 --> 00:52:52,544
<font color="white">About the Lady of the First Rank's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

500
00:52:52,627 --> 00:52:55,964
<font color="white">They say her body has yet to be found.</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:53:01,970 --> 00:53:03,889
<font color="white">My husband may be over the hill,</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:53:03,972 --> 00:53:06,182
<font color="white">but news reaches him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">quickly enough, you see.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

503
00:53:07,767 --> 00:53:09,769
<font color="white">I hear His Majesty</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:53:10,854 --> 00:53:15,025
<font color="white">ordered someone to find the body today.</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:53:16,443 --> 00:53:20,030
<font color="white">Your cousin, Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:54:12,624 --> 00:54:14,250
<font color="white">What are you doing out here?</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:54:15,293 --> 00:54:16,211
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:54:17,337 --> 00:54:18,505
<font color="white">You are home late.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
